sequenceDiagram
    participant Runtime as Caikit Runtime<br/>(caikit-tgis-serving)
    participant Backend as TGISBackend<br/>Backend Plugin
    participant Conn as TGISConnection<br/>Connection Manager
    participant LB as GRPCLoadBalancerProxy<br/>DNS-based LB
    participant DNS as DNS Resolver<br/>53/UDP
    participant TGIS_R as Remote TGIS Server<br/>gRPC/HTTP2

    Note over Runtime, TGIS_R: Flow 1: Remote TGIS Inference Request

    Runtime->>Backend: get_connection(model_id)
    Backend->>Conn: get_client()

    Note over LB, DNS: DNS polling (every 10s default)
    LB->>DNS: socket.getaddrinfo(hostname)
    DNS-->>LB: IP addresses
    Note over LB: Detect new endpoints,<br/>reconnect channels if changed

    Conn->>LB: Generate(request)
    LB->>TGIS_R: gRPC/HTTP2<br/>TLS 1.2+ / mTLS<br/>CA cert + client certs
    TGIS_R-->>LB: GenerationResponse
    LB-->>Conn: Response
    Conn-->>Runtime: Result

    Note over Runtime, TGIS_R: Flow 1b: Streaming Inference

    Runtime->>Conn: GenerateStream(request)
    Conn->>LB: GenerateStream(request)
    LB->>TGIS_R: gRPC server-stream<br/>TLS/mTLS
    loop Stream tokens
        TGIS_R-->>LB: GenerationStreamResponse
        LB-->>Conn: Token chunk
        Conn-->>Runtime: Yield token
    end

    participant Subprocess as ManagedTGISSubprocess<br/>Process Manager
    participant Health as Health Monitor<br/>Thread
    participant TGIS_L as Local TGIS<br/>text-generation-launcher
    participant FS as Filesystem<br/>prompt_dir

    Note over Runtime, FS: Flow 2: Local TGIS Subprocess Management

    Runtime->>Backend: start(local_mode)
    Backend->>Subprocess: launch TGIS
    Subprocess->>TGIS_L: subprocess.Popen<br/>text-generation-launcher

    loop Health polling during bootup
        Health->>TGIS_L: HTTP GET /health<br/>3000/TCP plaintext
        TGIS_L-->>Health: Health status
    end

    Note over Subprocess: TGIS ready

    Runtime->>Subprocess: Generate(request)
    Note over Subprocess: AutoRecoveringGenerationServiceStub
    Subprocess->>TGIS_L: gRPC<br/>50055/TCP plaintext
    TGIS_L-->>Subprocess: GenerationResponse

    alt RPC failure (UNAVAILABLE, INTERNAL, etc.)
        TGIS_L-->>Subprocess: Error
        Subprocess->>Health: Check health
        Health->>TGIS_L: HTTP GET /health
        TGIS_L-->>Health: Unhealthy
        Subprocess->>TGIS_L: Kill & restart subprocess
        Note over Subprocess, TGIS_L: Auto-recovery complete
    end

    Note over Runtime, FS: Flow 3: Prompt Artifact Loading

    Runtime->>Conn: load_prompt_artifacts(model_id, source_path)
    Conn->>FS: shutil.copyfile<br/>Copy prompt vectors to prefix store
    FS-->>Conn: Artifacts copied
    Note over TGIS_R: TGIS reads prompts from<br/>mounted prompt_dir volume
